# dotswitch keep list: your data, as opposed to a theme's look.
#
# When you switch themes, these are copied from the theme you leave to the
# theme you switch to, so they follow you. `dotswitch restore` keeps them too.
#
# One path per line, relative to your home folder (as you see it through the
# active theme). Folders are merged: nothing is deleted on the other side.
# Whatever a carried file replaces is saved under ~/.mydotfiles/backups/dotswitch/.
# A path is only carried when the other theme uses that app at all (it has
# ~/.config/<app>), so a theme without Quickshell or ML4W stays clean.

